{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Bear and Share Burdens"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, if a man is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "caught"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "overtaken in any trespass, you who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spiritual restore such a one in a spirit of gentleness, considering yourself lest you also be tempted. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Bear one another’s burdens, and so fulfill the law of Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if anyone thinks himself to be something, when he is nothing, he deceives himself. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But let each one examine his own work, and then he will have rejoicing in himself alone, and not in another. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For each one shall bear his own load."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Be Generous and Do Good"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let him who is taught the word share in all good things with him who teaches."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not be deceived, God is not mocked; for whatever a man sows, that he will also reap. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For he who sows to his flesh will of the flesh reap corruption, but he who sows to the Spirit will of the Spirit reap everlasting life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And let us not grow weary while doing good, for in due season we shall reap if we do not lose heart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, as we have opportunity, let us do good to all, especially to those who are of the household of faith."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Glory Only in the Cross"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "See with what large letters I have written to you with my own hand! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As many as desire to make a good showing in the flesh, these "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "would"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " compel you to be circumcised, only that they may not suffer persecution for the cross of Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For not even those who are circumcised keep the law, but they desire to have you circumcised that they may boast in your flesh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But God forbid that I should boast except in the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ, by "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or which, the cross"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whom the world has been crucified to me, and I to the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in Christ Jesus neither circumcision nor uncircumcision avails anything, but a new creation."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Blessing and a Plea"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as many as walk according to this rule, peace and mercy "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " upon them, and upon the Israel of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "From now on let no one trouble me, for I bear in my body the marks of the Lord Jesus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with your spirit. Amen."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}